Yun Yaad Na Kar Ghar Me Sughra Ali Akber Ku<br>
Pardes Me Aada Ne Maara Ali Akber Ku<br>
<br>
1.Majboor tera Bhai Seene Pe Seena Khayi<br>
Taiyar Tha Aane Ku Afsoos Aajal Aayi<br>
Tha yaad Bhot Din Se Wada Ali Abker Ku<br>
<br>
2.Taiyari Thi Shadi Ki Jab Waqt-e-Aajal Aaya<br>
Barchi Me Kaleja Bhi Seene Se Nikal Aaya<br>
Afsoos Na Raaz Aaya Sehra Ali Akber Ku<br>
<br>
3.Puche Koi Sarwar Se Kya Haal Howa Us Dum<br>
Jab Mout Pe Akber Ki Zainab Ne Kiya Matam<br>
Kis Tarah Bhulati Thi Laila Ali Akber Ku<br>
<br>
4.Aankhou Ki Basarath Bhi Shabbir Gawa Baithe<br>
Akber Ke Janaze Par Rokar Yehin Khete They<br>
Kis Waqt Me Khismat Ne Cheena Ali Akber Ku<br>
<br>
5.Seene Se Lahu Jaari Hum Shakle Paiyambar Ke<br>
Dekha Toh Phuphi Royi Khene Laagi Sarwar<br>
Tha Koun Shaqi Jisne Maara Ali Akber Ku<br>
<br>
6.Aathara Baras Paala Zainab Ne Muradou Se<br>
Yeh Daag-e-Judaai Ka Zainab Se Uthe Kaise<br>
Dum Todhte Zainab Ne Dekha Ali Akber Ku<br>
<br>
7.Rehan Madine Me Jis Waqt Qabar Pahunchi<br>
Pardes Me Akber Ke Seene Pe Laahi Barchi<br>
Taa Umr Na Payengi Sughra Ali Akber Ku
